{"scope":"knowledge","page":3,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-10f202611f6c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Storyboard, Keyframe, And Motion Rubric","description":"genuinely differ — in knowledge timing, audience alignment, performance space, strongest image, landing, losses, or production fit? pressure, camera rhythm, reaction landing, and sound movement carry **one** dramatic turn? merely to satisf…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-visual-motion.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1548a9030b73","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"内容合规检查清单","description":"以下正面价值在剧本中应有所体现（不强求每个都有，但整体价值观导向要正确）：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/compliance-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-197fd24f79f1","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"上传与发布","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed4301b7d0404ef4782f7 （2026-08-13 13:37）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/publish.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1a8bd93d8895","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"五份创作文档","description":"这是一份建议格式，不是 schema。优先让人一眼读懂；只有跨文档引用和投产定位需要稳定 ID。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/creator-documents.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1cd93b312904","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"多集整稿接入与断点续跑","description":"当创作者给的是一份已经写好的多集剧本、散稿或合订稿，并希望生成或补齐 `项目开发/episode-map.jsonl` 时使用本流程。它不是小说改编分析，也不是把整份文件塞进一次 提示词：**Agent 判断这份文件实际怎样分集、每集讲了什么；脚本只保存精确定位并防止重复劳动**。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/multi-episode-intake.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-1f76d5744a08","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"剧本阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/剧本.md`：场景、动作、对白、画外音、声音事实、画面文字、连续性提示与转场。 它继承项目/分集决定，但不决定人物视觉身份、镜头构图、提示词或媒体生产。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-24860391a810","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"反派设计体系","description":"微短剧的反派不是\"坏人\"那么简单。反派的质量直接决定了爽点的质量——主角打脸一个路人甲，观众无感；打脸一个嚣张了十集的恶人，观众拍手叫好。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2694978f9f0c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"结算","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed443124e9404bb0a1fa3 （2026-08-13 13:38）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/settle.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-27721e0bd833","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"钩子设计指南","description":"**定义**：在结尾制造未解之谜，激发好奇心。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/hook-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-28296bcd74de","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"可替换实现：让「要改」的时候改的是实现方式，不是戏","description":"**本套件不内置任何平台的审核标准，不预测任何内容能否通过，也不给出题材禁令**。 标准随平台、地区、时间和分发方式变化，写进技能只会同时做到两件坏事：过时，以及把 创作者本可以拍的东西提前劝退。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/substitutable-realization.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a3028f0584c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧评审门禁（review gates）——写完/做完必过，且必须举证","description":"> 借鉴 worldwonderer 的 `reviewed_invariant` 纪律：**评审必须引用具体节拍/字段/台词，不许说「不够抓人」这种空话。** > 每一项打分 1–10，**任一 ≤6 就重写**；标 ⛔ 的是硬伤，**必须修**、不接受\"宽进\"。 > 顺序：写 bible → 过 A、B；写每集 script/lines → 过 C、D、E；出片 → 过 F、G。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/drama-review-rubric.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a54fbcb0c61","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"起点—变化—终点：视频运动说明","description":"1. 目的、输入与权属 2. 起止边界清单 3. 运动说明的七个部分 4. 从结构化规格到自然语言 5. 输出、常见问题与检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/motion-recipe.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2a83321bc792","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"一张参考图可以决定什么","description":"绑定参考图等于告诉下游“哪些地方照着它”。不说明边界，身份参考会越权决定服装、构图、背景或文字。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/reference-roles.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2b500ae5b1ca","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"冲突、揭示、反转与回报的条件方法","description":"这是一组按项目条件选择的工具，不是题材公式。先问作品承诺什么体验，再选择能让人物付出代价、 让观众获得回报的机制。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/reveal-reversal-payoff.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2d6bcce55858","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"母版、补拍与替代版","description":"缩小提示词范围经常是正确修复。危险不是“变短”，而是把只拍了一部分的版本悄悄当成母版，使未被 它承担的对白、反应、揭示或终点从此无人负责。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/pickup-and-alternate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2d840992386b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"节奏曲线设计","description":"微短剧的节奏不是\"一直爽\"，而是\"紧→松→更紧→松→最紧\"的波形。就像过山车，持续加速反而麻木，有起有落才刺激。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-2fcc92eaa6d0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"图片提示词审查量表与合成案例","description":"1. 审查方式 2. 证据量表 3. 完成前结构检查 4. 合成正例 5. 合成反例","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-35794cf010a0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"制作质量检查：各环节怎么审、返工怎么防","description":"来自对完整生产链返工原因的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。审查方法见 [review-method.md](review-method.md)。本文展开 `REV-08` 与 `REV-09`：检查具体 必须保留的内容是否还在，而不是用样本规模、固定数量或所谓命中率证明质量。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/production-quality-gates.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3948263c77e2","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"导演阐述工艺：拆分/分镜前的项目级指令","description":"来自对导演阐述如何约束完整生产链的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。导演阐述是 整条流程里影响很大的人工输入：写在拆分/分镜之前，约束全剧后续工作——分镜 格式、摄影职责、节奏方向和已知能力条件。在本套件中，它落入 `short-drama.json#/creator_authority` 中的 `visual_direction` 与 `production_profile`， 由本技能在 `项目开发/director-brief.md` 中起草候选并展示语义差异。创作者接…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/director-brief-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3af0e802c492","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"题材、画风、场景与提示词 Know-how 学习","description":"本流程扩展完整项目链阅读，专门积累“在什么题材承诺、制作形态、视觉方向和场景职责下， 哪种提示词机制可能解决什么问题”。它不做提示词词频、风格代码排行或任务成功率分析。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/prompt-production-learning.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3b407b8465f1","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"节奏曲线系统","description":"每集时长约 1.5–3 分钟，内部节奏遵循三段式：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4159fa045772","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"从剧本提取资产出现记录","description":"出现记录说明“某段剧本在某处要求了什么”，它不是资产身份本身。先记录出现，再判断 它对应哪个资产，可以避免把同一人物的几套衣服拆成几个人，也能避免把两个同称谓的人 误并成一人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/occurrence-extraction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-44b609dc51df","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"视频提示词阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/视频提示词.md` 中的 `MOTION-...` 项与按需的时间线音乐章节。它继承镜头 起点、终点、时长、对白和冻结帧，不回写分镜或视觉设定：镜头边界、职责、起终状态和关键帧正文都不在 本阶段手里。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4541f2f494f5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"原著分析审查表","description":"`项目开发/source-analysis/` 下由 `$short-drama-novel-analyze` 发布的分析层： `_index.json`、`triage.md`、`chapters/*.md`、`story-units.md`、`rhythm-and-emotion.md`、 `characters.md`、`world.md`、`adaptation-value.md`、`episode-candidates.jsonl`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-source-analysis.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}}]}
